      "created_at": "2015-01-17T22:16:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I preordered (paid for them)&nbsp;WotC and the mini expansions at my local game store in November. They got the WotC boxes early, but were not allowed to release them, so I received them on 12/30 when they 'went live'. Now the mini expansions are still floating in the ether somewhere. I can only hope that my gaming circle does not tire of this game before they arrive. :/</p>",
